{
  "hadith_number": 32,
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Sayyid, sadib and Malik,ib and Sinan al-Qudri, may Allah be pleased to finde. The messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, there should be neither harming nor reciprocating harm. A good hindi, related by ibn Majah, ad-daraqudni and others, and ranked as Musnad. It was also related by Malik, in al-Mu'ata, as Musnad, with a chain of authorities from Am Ibn Ya'ya, from his father, from the Prophet, made the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, but leaving at Abu Sayyid, and he has other chains of authorities that support one another.",
